# SHA-256 of the Go toolchain archives the CI image downloads
# (build/ci/Containerfile checks the one for its architecture before it
# unpacks it). One line per file of go.mod's Go version, as https://go.dev/dl/?mode=json
# lists them. Moving go.mod to another Go version needs its lines here, or the
# image does not build.
